  abstract = {Incentive mechanism in modern management gets more and more attention,which has no exception in university management.The effect will be better by drawing up particular Incentive mechanism for different group.As staff in university is almost knowledge based,it could mobilize the staff's enthusiasm,initiative,creativity and has better incentive effect by incentive mechanism based on the flexible management than the traditional rigid management.},
}

